{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0033_1000_p", "source_sha256": "315344030365dd3fc334c981f711fb6d7fe2c015f0b0591e5f1f8811def93633", "ja": "イベントお疲れさま、亜利沙。大盛況だったな。\n凛々しい感じも、よく似合ってたよ。", "zh": "活动辛苦了，亚利沙。现场气氛非常热烈。\n帅气凛然的感觉也很适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0033_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "3c02e9af875287393fcc4d7c3e1a2f6f94359149ae219993503e47b305fec3c2", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、お疲れさまです！\nありさ、そう言ってもらえると嬉しいですケド……", "zh": "{$P$}先生也辛苦了！\n亚利沙听到您这么说虽然很高兴，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0033_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "b3d3cd76c377ad621b73870d9f2ca47765a140fd7dcc320b708507f7a742d378", "ja": "ロコちゃんや真美ちゃん、みんながいたから、\nありさも120％の力が出せたんだと思いますっ！", "zh": "有ROCO、真美，还有大家在，阿莉莎才能发挥出120％的力量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0033_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3e37722493f5de9a0829acfc4f79ebb1fcac64944827943faf17e71a6280a960", "ja": "そうだな、みんな頑張ってたもんな。\nところで、筋肉痛はもう大丈夫なのか？", "zh": "是啊，大家都很努力呢。\n话说回来，你的肌肉酸痛已经没事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0033_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "536c28b5aca51be368421e141d61530d871ca8576ef5b2d48a4277e55ca2a85c", "ja": "はい♪　{$P$}さんのおかげで……\n……あ、ダメです！　その話はやめてください～！", "zh": "是的♪多亏了{$P$}先生……\n……啊，不行！请别再说那件事了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0033_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1cae5de6a0a7214b08a5e27ae7c4e48c1f704f1722e62aaf1f28592337247469", "ja": "な、なんだ？　どうしたんだ、亜利沙。", "zh": "怎、怎么了？发生什么事了，亚利沙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0033_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "8a689e5cb71c6ec7917186bb0bd59b306cfd3162dfc6aa093335ee7014cf9830", "ja": "だって、だって！　{$P$}さんが、\nああ、亜利沙の足を……思い出したら……。", "zh": "因为、因为！{$P$}先生，啊，一想到亚利沙的脚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0033_1007_p", "source_sha256": "fa5820495733d170aae20e4ed5991c51e7101d4e0180549cf59a380b97939056", "ja": "そうだな、だいぶ凝ってるみたいだったな。\nああ、今からまた揉んでやろうか？", "zh": "是啊，感觉确实挺僵的。啊，要不要我现在再帮你揉一揉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0033_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "0b85b3506c3d38f03f55782a552542ecc81d3e2507b103c13fe5aa5c1dbe13cb", "ja": "やぁ～んっ！　そ、そんなのダメですよぉ～っ！？\n亜利沙の足のコトは、今すぐ忘れてください～っ！", "zh": "呀——！那、那种事不行啦～！？  \n请现在马上忘掉亚利沙的脚吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
